+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+ 
| Constraint Bitmask (8B) | Atomic State Flag (8B) | Shadow Buffer (48B)            | Line 2 (64B)
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

The zero-copy shadow memory structure is laid out in contiguous physical memory pages pinned via `mlock()` to prevent swap thrashing and Page Fault exceptions during validation routines:

```rust
