### System Architectural Invariants

1. **Zero Dynamic Allocation on Hot-Paths:** Message parsing and header extraction must never invoke the global allocator (`GlobalAlloc`). Memory buffers are pre-allocated during sandbox initialization inside a pinned ring buffer pool.
